# The bundled YAML parser and its licence are committed as the flake builds
# them, byte for byte, which `nix flake check` compares: no line-ending
# conversion, whatever core.autocrlf says. The bundles are generated, so
# GitHub folds them in a diff and leaves them out of the language stats.
/plugin/vendor/*/*.js -text linguist-generated
/plugin/vendor/*/LICENSE -text
# The module and JSON copy the protocol's spec compiles to are committed as
# `spec-build` writes them, which `checks.spec` compares the same way.
/plugin/src/protocol/spec.ts -text linguist-generated
/plugin/spec/kanban.json -text linguist-generated
